{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYDLESS is a fast-paced FPS built around momentum, skill, and a deadly bouncing ball, the more you punch it, the faster it gets, turning it into a high-speed, projectile of destruction. It fuses together classic movement shooters with a unique bouncing ball weapon. </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/02b4cd109750677c234234583efedbd4.poster.avif?t=1758704615\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/02b4cd109750677c234234583efedbd4.webm?t=1758704615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/02b4cd109750677c234234583efedbd4.mp4?t=1758704615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Reality is breaking. Trapped in an anomaly, you are Diego, an employee of Randy\u2019s Burger, a  fast-food chain at the end of the \u201890s. But something is wrong. The restaurant keeps shifting, twisting into increasingly distorted versions of itself.\u00a0</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/e1d4dd86ce81e79061e2c60986140423.poster.avif?t=1758704615\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/e1d4dd86ce81e79061e2c60986140423.webm?t=1758704615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/e1d4dd86ce81e79061e2c60986140423.mp4?t=1758704615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Use your agility and mastery of movement to navigate the chaos and avoid relentless attacks from the  customers, twisted by the shifting reality of the restaurant.Destroy them with your weapon a high-speed bouncing ball that gains more power the faster it moves. Punch it, control it and Turn every room into a deadly playground.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/c873e9ac05dc2a30f88aada2b58d9a06.poster.avif?t=1758704615\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/c873e9ac05dc2a30f88aada2b58d9a06.webm?t=1758704615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this Demo play through select levels from Chapter One and unlock two new powers to boost your mobility and combat style. Each stage challenges you to move fast, play smart, and climb the ranks with your speed and skill. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/ef156377b4f1278d92f87b44b8437c7d.poster.avif?t=1758704615\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/ef156377b4f1278d92f87b44b8437c7d.webm?t=1758704615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/ef156377b4f1278d92f87b44b8437c7d.mp4?t=1758704615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Master each stage, and push your skills to the limit as you fight to escape the loop\u2026 if escape is even possible.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947930?t=1758704615","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947930?t=1758704615","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/55ff0143e0087abfe488e720e594778b867fbf35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758704615","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/55ff0143e0087abfe488e720e594778b867fbf35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758704615","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYDLESS is a fast-paced FPS built around momentum, skill, and a deadly bouncing ball, the more you punch it, the faster it gets, turning it into a high-speed, projectile of destruction. It fuses together classic movement shooters with a unique bouncing ball weapon. </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/02b4cd109750677c234234583efedbd4.poster.avif?t=1758704615\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/02b4cd109750677c234234583efedbd4.webm?t=1758704615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/02b4cd109750677c234234583efedbd4.mp4?t=1758704615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Reality is breaking. Trapped in an anomaly, you are Diego, an employee of Randy\u2019s Burger, a  fast-food chain at the end of the \u201890s. But something is wrong. The restaurant keeps shifting, twisting into increasingly distorted versions of itself.\u00a0</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/e1d4dd86ce81e79061e2c60986140423.poster.avif?t=1758704615\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/e1d4dd86ce81e79061e2c60986140423.webm?t=1758704615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/e1d4dd86ce81e79061e2c60986140423.mp4?t=1758704615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Use your agility and mastery of movement to navigate the chaos and avoid relentless attacks from the  customers, twisted by the shifting reality of the restaurant.Destroy them with your weapon a high-speed bouncing ball that gains more power the faster it moves. Punch it, control it and Turn every room into a deadly playground.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/c873e9ac05dc2a30f88aada2b58d9a06.poster.avif?t=1758704615\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/c873e9ac05dc2a30f88aada2b58d9a06.webm?t=1758704615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this Demo play through select levels from Chapter One and unlock two new powers to boost your mobility and combat style. Each stage challenges you to move fast, play smart, and climb the ranks with your speed and skill. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947930/extras/ef156377b4f1278d92f87b44b8